xa ne yagixin naxɛtɛ.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"E xa liga","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"alo sɛxɛn naxan solima banxin fari,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"sogen yi a xara ayi.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Muxun naxan a xabama","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"hali yii fe kedenna a mi a sɔtɔma,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"hali xidi kedenna","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"a raxidi muxun fan mi a sɔtɔma.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Dangu muxune mi a falama e xa,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"e naxa, “Alatala xa barakan sa ɛ fe yi.”","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Hanma e naxa,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"“Nxu dubama ɛ xa Alatala xinli.”","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/yal_pbt/PSA/129.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/yal_pbt/PSA/130.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/yal_pbt/PSA/128.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":8}